# Atomic-write temp files from `generate_v3_fixtures::write_v3_fixtures_atomically`.
# The PID-keyed suffix means each generator run writes to a unique
# tmp path; if the rename ever fails (cross-device, permission flip,
# AV scanner lock on Windows), the tmp file lingers. Ignored here so
# nobody accidentally `git add tests/fixtures/*.tmp.*`.
*.tmp.*
